## Demo flow
Upload → Overview → Headers → URLs & IOCs → Attachments → MIME → Timeline → Evidence.

## Important limitation
The risk score is a demonstration rule engine, not a trained ML model. For the hackathon, it can later be extended with a lightweight NLP classifier, URL lexical model, threat-intelligence enrichment, graph correlation, and confidence-aware infrastructure mapping.

